WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:01.240
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:03.700
<v><b>A:</b></v> Have you done all your Christmas shopping?

00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:06.560
<v><b>B:</b></v> Pretty much, apart from a few bits and pieces.

00:00:07.493 --> 00:00:08.166
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:11.866
<v><b>A:</b></v> So do you consider the project to have been a success?

00:00:12.132 --> 00:00:16.054
<v><b>B:</b></v> By and large. I think we achieved almost everything we set out to do.

00:00:18.022 --> 00:00:18.842
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:19.642 --> 00:00:21.905
<v><b>F:</b></v> You looked really fed up after the meeting.

00:00:22.252 --> 00:00:26.315
<v><b>M:</b></v> Yes, I’m sick and tired of being put down every time I make a suggestion.

00:00:28.252 --> 00:00:29.039
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:29.992 --> 00:00:31.964
<v><b>A:</b></v> How often do you visit your parents?

00:00:32.317 --> 00:00:35.240
<v><b>B:</b></v> I see them on and off, but not as much as I should.

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:38.053
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:38.867 --> 00:00:40.072
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you feeling better now?

00:00:40.252 --> 00:00:43.361
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, thanks, I’ve been up and about for a couple of days.

00:00:45.288 --> 00:00:46.272
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:47.078 --> 00:00:49.412
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you catch the 6.15 train?

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:51.520
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, but it was touch and go.

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:56.075
We didn’t get to the station till ten past and had to run to the platform.